							<h1 class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><font color="#0000ff">Awards<span><?xml:namespace prefix = o /><o:p></o:p></span></font></h1> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt">Some people just rock, and what better way to show them that we notice? An award of course!&nbsp; In order to get an award, a member would nominate someone, then people can choose to vote on whether or not the player should get the awards.&nbsp; Players who receive an award will go on the "Wall of Heros!"&nbsp; (This exludes MVP, as this award requires 20 votes)&nbsp; Members on probationary status are not eligble for these awards.</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/flowerline2_e0.gif" /></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt">Awards:</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = v /><v:shapetype id=_x0000_t75 coordsize="21600,21600" o:spt="75" o:preferrelative="t" path="m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe" filled="f" stroked="f"><v:stroke joinstyle="miter"></v:stroke><v:formulas><v:f eqn="if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 1 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum 0 0 @1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @2 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 0 1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @6 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @8 21600 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @10 21600 0"></v:f></v:formulas><v:path o:extrusionok="f" gradientshapeok="t" o:connecttype="rect"></v:path><o:lock v:ext="edit" aspectratio="t"></o:lock></v:shapetype><font color="#0000ff"></font></span>&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><font color="#0000ff"><strong>Award of Excellence </strong></font></span></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><font color="#0000ff"><strong></strong></font></span></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><img src="/pics/1602/potofgold.gif" /></span></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center">Awarded to those who are excellent at what they do!&nbsp; This may be an excellent puller, healer, slower, tank, rezzer, twitcher, ect..</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"></span>&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><font color="#0000ff"><strong>Medallion of Compassion</strong></font></span></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><img src="/pics/1602/Awards/award2.bmp" /></span></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center">Awarded to those who show extreme caring or kindness to others.</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><strong></strong></span></b>&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><strong><font color="#0000ff">Tribute of Guardians</font></strong></span></b></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"></span></b></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/bluewhit_e0.gif" /></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center">Awarded for those who save another from a sticky situation or certain death!</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><strong></strong></span></b>&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><strong><font color="#0000ff">Prize of Sacrifice</font></strong></span></b></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"></span></b></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/pombo.gif" /></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center">Awarded to those who “take one for the team.”&nbsp; (such as dying for the better good of a raid, for example)</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"></span>&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><strong><font color="#0000ff">Plaque of Patience </font></strong></span></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><img src="/pics/1602/Awards/award3.bmp" /></span></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center">Awarded for those who show extreme patience with the guild or guildies.</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><strong></strong></span></b>&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><strong><font color="#0000ff">Cross of Aide </font></strong></span></b></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"></span></b></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/cupidr_e0.gif" /></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center">Awarded to those who are extra helpful to someone in need!</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"></span>&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><strong><font color="#0000ff">Medallion of Leadership </font></strong></span></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><img src="/pics/1602/Awards/medal.bmp" /></span></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center">Awarded to those who lead a raid or other guild event wonderfully!</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><strong></strong></span></b>&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><strong><font color="#0000ff">Mark of Punctuality </font></strong></span></b></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"></span></b></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/star_e0.gif" /></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center">Awarded to those who are always on time! (A minimum of 5 occasions)</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center">&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><strong><font color="#0000ff">Member of the Month </font></strong></span></b></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"></span></b></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><img src="/pics/1602/rotstar2_e0.gif" /></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center">Awarded to those who rock in general!&nbsp; </p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center">&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><strong><font color="#0000ff">MVP</font></strong></span></b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"> </span></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt"><img src="/pics/1602/Awards/trophy1.gif" /></span></p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align="center">The most valuable of all awards, this is only awarded to a member who has received at least 1 other award and requires a minimum of 20 people voting for them.</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt">&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"><a href="/forums/threadlist.aspx?fid=1554">Nominate </a>someone for an award..</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt">&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt">See the <a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1471">Wall of Heros</a>!</p> <p>&nbsp;</p>
							
